n jungle to the frozen poles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different ways to play! Test your reaction time, strategy, and your ability to work under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends in co-op mode to double the chaos (and the fun), or compete in PvP to see who is the master of organization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/1ac1f0f85f2c280b3778d48ea0839fb5.poster.avif?t=1756079979\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/1ac1f0f85f2c280b3778d48ea0839fb5.webm?t=1756079979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Odyssey on Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intergalactic rescue mission went totally wrong! The ET siblings tried to land on Earth, but collided with a satellite and fell right into the middle of the\u2026 <i>muvuca</i>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your almanac with all the different humans you find along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the badges by completing all the modes and challenges in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics with crispy pixels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique soundtrack, the most lively in the galaxy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/e30d0d3f911c83ba9fd28f1603cf9df3.poster.avif?t=1756079979\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/e30d0d3f911c83ba9fd28f1603cf9df3.webm